@startuml 022-employee-dashboard-seq-lifecycle
title Employee Dashboard - Data Aggregation Sequence

actor Employee
participant "EmployeeDashboardController" as Ctrl
participant "EmployeeDashboardService" as Svc
database "Database" as DB

Employee -> Ctrl: GET /api/v1/employee/dashboard
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc: getDashboard(currentUser)
activate Svc

== 1. Validate Scope ==
Svc -> DB: findPropertyIdsByEmployeeIdAndStatus(ACTIVE)
alt if propertyIds is empty
    Svc --> Ctrl: emptyDashboard() (noPropertyAssignment = true)
end

== 2. Aggregate Pending Tasks ==
Svc -> DB: countForDashboard (Housekeeping: PENDING/IN_PROGRESS)
Svc -> DB: countForDashboard (Maintenance: ASSIGNED/IN_PROGRESS)
Svc -> DB: countForEmployeeDashboard (Inspections: PENDING/IN_PROGRESS)

== 3. Fetch Previews (Max 5 each) ==
Svc -> DB: findPreviewForDashboard (Housekeeping)
Svc -> DB: findPreviewForDashboard (Maintenance)
Svc -> DB: findForEmployee (Inspections)

== 4. Aggregate Completed Today ==
Svc -> DB: countCompletedToday (Housekeeping, dayStart, dayEnd)
Svc -> DB: countCompletedToday (Maintenance, dayStart, dayEnd)
Svc -> DB: countCompletedToday (Inspections, dayStart, dayEnd)
Svc -> DB: findCompletedToday (Housekeeping, Limit 3)
Svc -> DB: findCompletedToday (Maintenance, Limit 3)
Svc -> DB: findCompletedToday (Inspections, Limit 3)

== 5. Aggregate Unified "Today Tasks" ==
Svc -> DB: findTodayForDashboard (Housekeeping)
Svc -> DB: findTodayForDashboard (Maintenance)
Svc -> DB: findTodayForDashboard (Inspections)

== 6. Map to Response ==
Svc -> Svc: buildTodayTasks (Combine & limit to 10)
Svc -> Svc: build AwaitingSummary
Svc -> Svc: build CompletedTodaySummary
Svc --> Ctrl: EmployeeDashboardResponse
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> Employee: 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl
@enduml
